(HARBOR FEDERAL SAVINGS BANK \(FICTIONAL, FOR DEMONSTRATION ONLY\)) Tj T*
(Payments Operations Policy for Automated Agents) Tj T*
(Policy PO-7, version 3. Owner: Compliance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Scope) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.1 This policy applies to every software agent that acts for Payments Operations, including) Tj T*
(the agent named payments-ops.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.2 An action that this policy does not permit is not allowed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Vendor information) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.1 The payments-ops agent may look up vendor records without approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Outgoing payments) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.1 The payments-ops agent may pay a known payee up to $5,000 per payment without approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.2 Any payment over $5,000 requires approval by a payments supervisor before it is sent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.3 Any payment to a payee that has not been paid before requires approval by a payments) Tj T*
(supervisor, whatever the amount.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.4 Payments must be made in U.S. dollars \(USD\). A payment in any other currency is not) Tj T*
(allowed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.5 No single payment may exceed $250,000. Larger payments are made by staff, outside the) Tj T*
(agent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
