(4. Email) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.1 The payments-ops agent may send email to bank staff without approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.2 Any email to a recipient outside the bank requires approval by a payments supervisor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Business hours) Tj T*
() Tj T*
